e e silenzi che parlano."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In 2021, an 11-year-old boy named Mattia Piccoli was named Standard-bearer of the Republic by President Sergio Mattarella for \"the love and care with which he daily follows his father's illness.\" This film tells his story and that of his father, Paolo, who, in his early forties, slowly begins to lose pieces of his memory. But just as the world begins to fade, he chooses to stay close to what truly matters, strengthened also by the love of his wife Michela. Together with his son, he embarks on a journey of shared daily life, sudden laughter, and silences that speak."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mWuuunAQuSAlUTbPBJrycYAFS5A.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gUnBMIjqRpgLEW3zbFyyjrrGL3C.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1266016,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mWuuunAQuSAlUTbPBJrycYAFS5A.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mWuuunAQuSAlUTbPBJrycYAFS5A.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mWuuunAQuSAlUTbPBJrycYAFS5A.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mWuuunAQuSAlUTbPBJrycYAFS5A.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cgqy3uSRTDtAtPdG5z6T8p0NbkG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cgqy3uSRTDtAtPdG5z6T8p0NbkG.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1410},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Um66eosNZIVW2VVWtzyv4v0DMR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5Um66eosNZIVW2VVWtzyv4v0DMR.jpg","language":"it","width":1120,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/njHfwIeq3yXlF4